Fintech: Financial Technologies. A new world to know!
Fintech is a novel term, it is an acronym de the english words "Financial Technologies" which in Spanish would be equivalent to Financial Technologies.
Revolutionary Technologies and Finance for All: The FinTech
So therefore, Fintech can be defined as a concept that It brings together those companies in the financial field that contribute new ideas and economic and commercial models through the use of the new and most modern information technologies.
All this with the aim of making the economy and finance more personalized, faster, safer and anonymous for the individual and society as a whole., making them independent of the great traditional financial centers of the world.
They mediate in the world of finance in various ways, such as money transfers, loans, purchases and sales of securities or financial and investment advice, that is, they mediate in all areas of the world of finance acting as brokers, as payment mediators, as issuers and receivers of transfers or as financial advisers.
And while investors came out very scared from all that, they became somewhat suspicious and that has made Fintech companies grow slowly at first, but as new legal regulations are passed and the investor sees that they are trusted companies, little by little that fear has been lost and now, consequently intermediation in finance through Fintech companies is multiplying, year after year. Benefits
These ICT just like one day they transformed the world of music or written journalism, now they are going to transform our finances since from a simple Smartphone We will be able to control all our finances in a faster, more agile, secure, simple and, above all, much cheaper way.
And because of this, that great cake that only a few banks and companies in the international financial world were enjoying with each other, in order to preserve their positions and monopolies, and their eagerness to fatten their accounts with great results and profits, they have rested on their laurels and now Fintech companies are taking a good portion from them, offering the user a much better, more beautiful and cheaper alternative for their finances.
D.- Payments and collections through Smartphone and mobile devices: Fintech companies dedicated to allow or facilitate the use of portable devices to pay for purchases, and that they are leaders in this sector and the number of businesses and platforms that allow you to use this agile and innovative means of payment does not stop growing.
Will Fintech companies succeed in transforming the finance sector?
Additionally, it is more than certain that Companies and Projects Fintech, private and public, social or economic, will spread as a healthy epidemic throughout the planet to achieve supremacy over the Traditional Financial System.
