upcoin.- Currently in beta phase and planning to officially begin to be in full service around March 2018. It will offer a huge range of cryptocurrencies to exchange with really low commissions.
Waves.- He is another of those who is giving a lot to talk about, creating very good expectations. Also in beta phase, the deployment of its most desired features is scheduled to take place throughout 2018.
