Within the priestly nation of Israel , however , existed a distinct , ministerial priesthood , the Levitical priesthood .
We , too , are a priestly nation ; and within our ranks exists a special , sacramental priesthood charged with presiding over the Sacrifice of the Mass , our communal act of worship .
